# Note: data/ is intentionally committed — the git repo is the database
# (ADR-0002). It must contain no teaser or outlet text (ADR-0003).

# Benchmark pairs (headline+teaser) stay local for the same reason (issue #4):
# only the labels file, docs/research/decision-model-labels.json, is committed.
.benchmark/

# Private caches, never committed (ADR-0027's gitignored-cache precedent):
# .cache/teasers.json holds Outlet-written teaser text — never published
# (ADR-0003); .cache/refusals.json holds the Membership-refusal ledger —
# ids and instants only (issue #148). Both round-trip through the Actions
# cache, and both degrade to empty when missing — never a build failure.
.cache/
